<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080d1a">
<meta name="description" content="BR1Websides - Modern websites designed around your ideas.">
<title>BR1Websides | Your Website Starts Here</title>

<style>
:root{--bg:#080d1a;--panel:#101a2e;--blue:#3987ff;--cyan:#58c8ff;--text:#f3f6ff;--muted:#9ba9c3;--border:rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit}
.container{width:min(1120px,90%);margin:auto}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(8,13,26,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
nav{min-height:76px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px}
.logo span{color:var(--blue)}
.navlinks{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}
.navlinks a{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;transition:.2s}
.navlinks a:hover{color:white}
.menu-btn{display:none;background:none;color:white;border:0;font-size:25px;cursor:pointer}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:13px 23px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--blue),#2360db);color:white;font-weight:750;border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:.25s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 35px #3987ff45}
.btn-outline{background:transparent;border:1px solid #3987ff80}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}
.hero{min-height:660px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:90px 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 30%,#15356a55,transparent 50%)}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;align-items:center;gap:50px}
.eyebrow{color:var(--cyan);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:20px}
h1{font-size:clamp(43px,7vw,76px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-3px}
.gradient{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3987ff,#65d4ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero p{color:var(--muted);max-width:530px;margin:24px 0 30px;font-size:17px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:13px}
.preview{padding:13px;border:1px solid #3987ff50;border-radius:20px;background:#101a2e;box-shadow:0 25px 90px #0008;transform:rotate(2deg)}
.preview-top{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:9px 8px 16px}
.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#f87171}
.dot:nth-child(2){background:#facc15}
.dot:nth-child(3){background:#4ade80}
.preview-content{min-height:300px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#132e58,#091326);padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start}
.preview-content h2{font-size:32px;line-height:1.15}
.preview-content p{color:#b7c8e7;font-size:13px;margin:13px 0}
.preview-bar{height:8px;border-radius:20px;background:#3987ff;width:65%;margin-top:8px}
.preview-bar.short{width:40%;opacity:.4}
section{padding:100px 0}
.section-title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:50px}
.section-title h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,43px);letter-spacing:-1px}
.section-title p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:17px;padding:27px;transition:.25s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:#3987ff80}
.card-icon{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:18px}
.card h3{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:10px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.portfolio-card{overflow:hidden;padding:0}
.portfolio-image{min-height:190px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#193d75,#101a2e)}
.portfolio-image.second{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#154b50,#101a2e)}
.portfolio-image.third{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#49316d,#101a2e)}
.mini-window{width:85%;background:#0b1425;border:1px solid #ffffff22;border-radius:9px;padding:13px;box-shadow:0 10px 25px #0005}
.mini-window div{height:7px;border-radius:10px;background:#3987ff;margin:8px 0;width:75%}
.mini-window div:nth-child(2){width:50%;opacity:.4}
.mini-window div:nth-child(3){width:35%;opacity:.6}
.portfolio-info{padding:22px}
.portfolio-info p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.step-number{color:var(--blue);font-size:32px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:12px}
.order-wrap{max-width:760px;margin:auto;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #3987ff55;border-radius:20px;padding:35px}
.order-wrap h3{font-size:25px;margin-bottom:8px}
.order-wrap>p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:28px;font-size:14px}
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}
.field.full{grid-column:1/-1}
label{font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:13px 14px;color:white;background:#091326;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;outline:none;transition:.2s}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--blue)}
select option{background:#101a2e}
textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:125px}
::placeholder{color:#687b9a}
.checkbox{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.checkbox input{width:auto;margin-top:4px}
.form-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-top:12px}
#formMessage,.message{margin-top:15px;color:var(--cyan);font-size:14px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.error{color:#ff9292!important}
.success{color:#7de6b0!important}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:35px 0}
.footer-content{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
footer p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.admin-link{color:#7186a8;font-size:12px}
.admin-link:hover{color:var(--cyan)}
#adminPage{display:none;min-height:75vh;padding:65px 0}
#adminPage.active{display:block}
.admin-shell{max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
.admin-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:25px}
.admin-top h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)}
.admin-panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:17px;padding:25px;margin-bottom:20px}
.admin-panel h3{margin-bottom:14px}
.admin-form{max-width:430px}
.admin-form .field{margin-bottom:15px}
.order-list{display:grid;gap:14px}
.order-item{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;background:#0b1425}
.order-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}
.order-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.order-description{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:12px 0}
.order-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.order-actions select{max-width:190px}
.small-btn{padding:9px 13px;font-size:13px}
.empty{color:var(--muted);padding:18px 0}
.hidden{display:none!important}
@media(max-width:760px){
.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.preview{max-width:480px;margin:auto}
.cards,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.navlinks{display:none;position:absolute;top:76px;left:0;width:100%;padding:25px;background:#0c1426;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.navlinks.open{display:flex}
.menu-btn{display:block}
.nav-cta{display:none}
.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.field.full{grid-column:auto}
.order-wrap{padding:23px}
section{padding:75px 0}
h1{letter-spacing:-2px}
.admin-panel{padding:18px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<header>
<div class="container">
<nav>
<a class="logo" href="#home">BR1<span>Websides</span></a>
<button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>
<div class="navlinks" id="navLinks">
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a>
<a href="#process">How it works</a>
<a href="#order">Order</a>
</div>
<a class="btn nav-cta" href="#order">Get a website</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<main id="publicPage">

<section class="hero" id="home">
<div class="container hero-grid">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Independent web design studio</div>
<h1>Your idea.<br>Our <span class="gradient">website.</span></h1>
<p>We create modern, stylish and responsive websites designed around your vision. Let's build something amazing together.</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn" href="#order">Start your project →</a>
<a class="btn btn-outline" href="#portfolio">Explore work</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="preview">
<div class="preview-top"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span></div>
<div class="preview-content">
<div class="eyebrow">DESIGNED FOR YOU</div>
<h2>Make your<br><span class="gradient">ideas happen.</span></h2>
<p>Beautiful websites. Made with creativity.</p>
<div class="preview-bar"></div>
<div class="preview-bar short"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="services">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
<div class="eyebrow">What we do</div>
<h2>Our Services</h2>
<p>Everything you need to build your online presence.</p>
</div>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card"><div class="card-icon">🌐</div><h3>Business Websites</h3><p>Professional websites to present your business, services and contact information.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="card-icon">🎨</div><h3>Custom Designs</h3><p>Unique designs built around your ideas, style and personal preferences.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="card-icon">📱</div><h3>Responsive Websites</h3><p>Websites that look great and work smoothly on phones, tablets and computers.</p></article>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="portfolio">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
<div class="eyebrow">Our creations</div>
<h2>Portfolio</h2>
<p>A preview of the kind of websites we can create.</p>
</div>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card portfolio-card">
<div class="portfolio-image"><div class="mini-window"><div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div>
<div class="portfolio-info"><h3>Business Website</h3><p>A clean and professional business layout.</p></div>
</article>
<article class="card portfolio-card">
<div class="portfolio-image second"><div class="mini-window"><div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div>
<div class="portfolio-info"><h3>Creative Studio</h3><p>A modern design for a creative brand.</p></div>
</article>
<article class="card portfolio-card">
<div class="portfolio-image third"><div class="mini-window"><div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div>
<div class="portfolio-info"><h3>Personal Website</h3><p>A personal space to show your work and ideas.</p></div>
</article>
</div>
<p style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:20px">These are design concepts, not completed client projects.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="process">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-title">
<div class="eyebrow">Simple process</div>
<h2>How It Works</h2>
<p>From your first idea to your finished website.</p>
</div>
<div class="steps">
<article class="card"><div class="step-number">01</div><h3>Send your idea</h3><p>Tell us what kind of website you need using our order form.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="step-number">02</div><h3>Discuss the project</h3><p>We discuss the details, timeline and price before starting.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="step-number">03</div><h3>Get your website</h3><p>We create your website and share it with you for review.</p></article>
</div>
</div>
